{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124275","id":4781880402,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHQW0Ug","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124275","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124275.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124275.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124275","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124275/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124275/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124275/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6c65cfae9f16b8f62d4a7103b254dec895e0cf6c","number":124275,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Define the result as `-INF` when a negative value is passed to `linear_to_db()`","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #109119\r\n- Supersedes/Closes #122982\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nInternally `linear_to_db()` is an approximation of `log10()`, but as the method name suggests, the purpose of the `linear_to_db()` function is not to get the `log()` result, but to get the \"dB\" value.\r\n\r\nWhile it is correct for `log()` to return `NaN` when passed a negative value, but it should be intuitive for `linear_to_db()` to return `-INF` when passed a negative value.\r\n\r\nThis PR means a minor breaking compat is included, but I think it is very rare for programs to depend on the case where `linear_to_db()` returns `NaN`, and if any such programs exist, there is a migration path to use `log()`.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":16503691,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A-9OL","url":"htt